  1,
  'WEB APPLICATION // LOGISTICS TELEMETRY',
  '[{"label":"Active Fleet","value":"124 / 130","sub":"95.4% In-Field"},{"label":"Sync Latency","value":"< 120ms","sub":"Sub-second Pings","blue":true},{"label":"SLA Impact","value":"-18.4%","sub":"Transit Variance","blue":true}]'::jsonb,
  'Logistics coordination across fragmented transport routes previously relied on manual WhatsApp groups, delayed spreadsheet waybills, and unverified driver check-ins. ALZERA architected and built LogiFlow—a unified, role-based telemetry portal that centralizes real-time vehicle positioning, automated waybill generation, and queue-based dispatcher assignments.',
  '[{"label":"Client / Domain","title":"Regional Fleet Logistics","sub":"Cross-island transport operator (Indonesia)"},{"label":"Deliverable Type","title":"Custom Web Application","sub":"Realtime Telemetry & Admin Console"},{"label":"Project Timeline","title":"8 Weeks Delivery","sub":"Milestone-based delivery (Q2 2024)"},{"label":"Core Role","title":"Full-Cycle Architecture","sub":"UI/UX Systems, Frontend & Backend"}]'::jsonb,
  'Prior to the deployment of LogiFlow, fleet dispatchers struggled with three high-cost systemic bottlenecks that directly eroded margin and created daily scheduling volatility.',
  '[{"icon":"spreadsheet","title":"Unsynchronized Dispatch Queues","desc":"Waybills created manually in spreadsheets caused duplicate vehicle bookings and average dispatch delays of 45+ minutes per driver staging cycle.","impact":"45+ min/cycle idle loss"},{"icon":"eye-off","title":"Blind Transit Periods","desc":"Regional transit routes suffered from zero real-time visibility, leading to unverified driver deviations, inaccurate customer ETAs, and lost cargo claims.","impact":"Zero location verifiability"},{"icon":"doc","title":"Disjointed Waybill Invoicing","desc":"Physical paper-based waybills delayed billing cycles by up to 14 business days while awaiting signed arrival manifests from remote destination ports.","impact":"14-day receivable lag"}]'::jsonb,
  'Rather than relying on generic off-the-shelf SaaS with prohibitive recurring per-seat licensing, ALZERA engineered an event-driven telemetry pipeline combining lightweight WebSockets with Redis in-memory pub/sub to stream driver GPS pings without overloading the relational database.',
  '[{"num":"01.","label":"INGESTION","title":"Driver Mobile PWA / GPS","desc":"In-cab GPS client transmits coordinate arrays, vehicle speed, and battery health every 5,000ms.","perf":"Payload: ~348 bytes / ping"},{"num":"02.","label":"STREAMING","title":"ALZERA Telemetry Gateway","desc":"Node.js + WebSockets server layer validating authentication tokens and route bounds instantly.","perf":"Throughput: 1,200 msg/sec"},{"num":"03.","label":"CACHING","title":"Redis In-Memory Pub/Sub","desc":"Broadcasts delta updates to subscribed operator browser rooms without database read locks.","perf":"Sub/Pub Fanout: 4ms"},{"num":"04.","label":"RENDERING","title":"Dispatcher Command Center","desc":"React + Leaflet web dashboard rendering vehicle markers with GPU-accelerated canvas layer.","perf":"Frame Rate: 60 FPS constant"}]'::jsonb,
  'Historical telemetry logs are batched into PostgreSQL (PostGIS) in 60-second intervals to minimize DB writes.',
  'DB Write Reduction: ~88%',
  'Engineered to perform in high-stress operational environments with strict role partitioning and fault-tolerant fallbacks.',
  '[{"num":"01","layer":"FRONTEND LAYER","title":"React 18 & Leaflet.js","desc":"Custom map vector layers with TanStack Query caching state.","pills":["React 18","Tailwind CSS","Leaflet"]},{"num":"02","layer":"REALTIME TELEMETRY","title":"WebSockets & Redis","desc":"Lightweight Node.js WebSocket gateway connected to Redis pub/sub channels.","pills":["Node.js","WebSockets","Redis"]},{"num":"03","layer":"SPATIAL DATA STORE","title":"PostgreSQL & PostGIS","desc":"Industrial spatial database with PostGIS geometry indexing.","pills":["PostgreSQL","PostGIS","Spatial Indexes"]},{"num":"04","layer":"SECURITY & INFRA","title":"Docker & Argon2 RBAC","desc":"Containerized deployment with strict security practices.","pills":["Docker","Argon2","Cloud VPS"]}]'::jsonb,
  'ALZERA prioritizes genuine engineering outcomes over exaggerated vanity metrics.',
  '[{"num":"01","title":"Zero-Lag Telemetry Processing","desc":"Sustained sub-120ms ping-to-screen updates.","metric":"< 120ms","metricLabel":"Ping-to-Screen Latency"},{"num":"02","title":"Elimination of Manual Spreadsheets","desc":"100% of driver assignments successfully migrated.","metric":"100%","metricLabel":"Digital Queue Migration"},{"num":"03","title":"Integrated Offline Resilience","desc":"Driver app caches updates locally.","metric":"0 Lost PODs","metricLabel":"Across Maritime Routes"}]'::jsonb,
  '[Sample Case Study]: Metrics tested in staged production environment.',
